WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
Two people hand over the same gift.

2
00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:04.740
Same box, same ribbon.

3
00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:06.500
One gives out of love.

4
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:10.080
The other wants a favour back: a bribe.

5
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:14.390
Is the act the same, or are they
really doing two different things?

6
00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.680
If two people do the same
thing for opposite reasons,

7
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.400
can one be right and the other wrong?

8
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.250
In this mission, you
will sort sin from crime,

9
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.080
and good from evil.

10
00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:28.940
Then you will find out why a
Buddhist might call a lie unskilful,

11
00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:30.710
rather than sinful.

12
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:34.540
Your mission: work out what
makes an act right or wrong,

13
00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.830
for believers and non-believers.
